  <p class="gd-byline" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--blue-soft);opacity:.9;margin:16px 0 0">By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Heliski Travel Team</a> · Updated 3 Aug 2026</p>
  <p class="gd-lede">If you have never done one, a heli-skiing tour can sound mysterious: how does the helicopter fit in, what happens between runs, and is it a single day or a whole week? The answer is simpler and better than most people expect. This is a clear walk through what a heli-ski tour actually is, how a guided day runs from the morning briefing to the last run, and how the tours we arrange in Iceland are put together, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
</div></section>
